+        *   Calculate the potential new quality: $Q_{new} = q[j - f_{si}(\theta)] + f_{qi}(\theta)$.
+        *   If $q[j] < Q_{new}$:
+            *   Update `q[j]` $\leftarrow Q_{new}$.
+            *   Record the choice: `choices[i][j]` $\leftarrow \theta$ [S1].
 
